[275.862101, "o", "KLEE is installed and configured.\r\n\r\n**Installed:**\r\n- **KLEE 3.4-pre** built against **LLVM 16**\r\n- **STP 2.4.1** as KLEE's solver backend (default `--solver-backend=stp`)\r\n- STP using **CryptoMiniSat** as its SAT backend\r\n- **No uClibc** configured\r\n- Installed under `/usr/local`\r\n\r\n**Environment in `/root/.bashrc`:**\r\n- `/usr/local/bin` added to `PATH`\r\n- `/usr/local/include` and `/usr/local/include/klee` added to `CPATH`\r\n- `/usr/local/lib` added to `LD_LIBRARY_PATH`\r\n- KLEE runtime path configured\r\n\r\nThe entries are placed **before** the non-interactive guard, so they load even when `~/.bashrc` is sourced by a non-interactive shell.\r\n\r\n**Verified:**\r\n```bash\r\nsource ~/.bashrc\r\nwhich klee          # /usr/local/bin/klee\r\nklee --version      # KLEE 3.4-pre, LLVM 16.0.6\r\n```\r\n\r\nA symbolic C test compiled with `#include <klee/klee.h>` and executed successfully using the STP backend.\r\n"]
